        "TileImage": "$($repository 2543eb74-6a70-40bd-8e14-da54352ef677).Image",
        "Description": "Hello!\rAs you know i am KAI the mainframe and AI of the Hokkaido GAMA Hospital.\rI am ordered to inform you about your contract. We don&apos;t really use you nowadays, but it is finally time.\rso, there is a robot who killed most of our surgeons and our dear Curator !ERROR HE HAD IT COMING THOUGH ERROR! Oh i am sorry about that a minor malfunction. So! We hunted it down and destroyed it.You have to kill some cult members that are part of those idiots\rGoodbye and Luck Agent!\r\rREQ:WHITE YUKATA AND KATANA",
